    "text": "The sum of all those terms which are rational numbers in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is:"
